ted (they are caller-precondition UB, not in-band checked errors), and `blake2b`'s internal `sodium_misuse()` aborts are unreachable because the public wrappers pre-validate and return -1 first.\n\n**Deliverables written:** `tests/hashing.rs`, `docs/hashing_ERRORS.md`, `docs/hashing_CONFIGS.md`.","usage":{"total_tokens":75163,"tool_uses":27,"duration_ms":439365},"uuid":"685de12b-409f-4160-8c10-003d969a02c1","session_id":"273db57d-0194-450c-88e2-05a6550af9c0"}
